{"subject": "📊 Daily Portfolio: Markets closed | Goal deadline missed, $453 to go", "html_body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f5f7; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #111827;\">\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"background-color: #f4f5f7; padding: 24px 12px;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"600\" style=\"max-width: 600px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden;\">\n\n        <!-- HERO BANNER -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e293b 0%, #334155 100%); padding: 32px 24px; color: #ffffff;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #94a3b8;\">Daily Portfolio Check</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 16px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #cbd5e1;\">Saturday, August 1, 2026 — Kuwait time — Markets closed (weekend)</p>\n\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n              <tr>\n                <td>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Total P&amp;L (realized, since inception)</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0 0; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 700; color: #ef4444;\">-$269.45</p>\n                </td>\n                <td align=\"right\" valign=\"bottom\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Today</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #9ca3af;\">$0.00 — no open positions</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n\n            <p style=\"margin: 16px 0 0 0; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid #475569; font-size: 13px; color: #e2e8f0;\">Investment goal target date (Jul 31, 2026) passed without hitting $1,000 — fully in cash after the CAPR stop-out, $453.42 still to go.</p>\n\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 14px; background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px;\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #f1f5f9;\">🎯 <strong>Investment goal:</strong> $546.58 / $1,000 — <strong style=\"color: #cbd5e1;\">$453.42 to go</strong> (54.7% there)</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0 0; font-size: 11px; color: #fca5a5;\">⚠️ Target date was Jul 31, 2026 — that deadline has now passed. Goal tracker is a progress indicator only; doesn't change entry discipline.</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- MACRO CONTEXT -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 16px 24px; background-color: #0d0d0d; border-left: 3px solid #f59e0b;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #f59e0b; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">🌍 Macro Context — Aug 1, 2026</p>\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #e5e7eb; font-family: monospace;\">\n              <tr><td style=\"padding: 3px 0; color: #9ca3af;\">Buffett Indicator</td><td style=\"padding: 3px 0; text-align: right;\">234.3% <span style=\"background-color: #7f1d1d; color: #fecaca; padding: 1px 8px; border-radius: 10px; font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 11px;\">🔴 ALL-TIME EXTREME</span></td></tr>\n              <tr><td style=\"padding: 3px 0; color: #9ca3af;\">S&amp;P Forward P/E</td><td style=\"padding: 3px 0; text-align: right;\">~21x (vs. 10-yr avg ~19x)</td></tr>\n              <tr><td style=\"padding: 3px 0; color: #9ca3af;\">Trend</td><td style=\"padding: 3px 0; text-align: right;\">↑ Rising (228.5% Jul 27 → 234.3% Jul 31)</td></tr>\n            </table>\n            <p style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #d1d5db; line-height: 1.6;\">Market cap is now 2.34x the entire US economy — every prior reading above 190% has preceded a multi-year drawdown, and we're 44 points past that line. Forward P/E (~21x) is elevated but not screaming yet — the Buffett Indicator is the more extreme signal right now.</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 6px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #d1d5db; line-height: 1.6;\">With zero open positions, this isn't a stop-loss question — it's an entry-timing one. Don't force size back on just to chase the $1,000 goal; wait for stock-finder to surface a real setup rather than buying into a historically stretched tape.</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 11px; color: #6b7280;\">Last historical episodes near this level: 2000 dot-com peak (~172%), 2021 post-COVID peak (~200%) — current reading has no clean historical precedent this high.</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 6px 0 0 0; font-size: 10px; color: #6b7280;\">Source: GuruFocus (234.3%, Jul 31 2026), MacroMicro (228.5%, Jul 27 2026), Fed financial stability report (forward P/E \"near upper end of historical range\").</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- POSITION NEWS -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 16px 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\">📰 Position News — Aug 1, 2026</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280;\">No open positions today — enhanced news watch is inactive. Nothing to scan for.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- POSITION SNAPSHOT -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 0 24px 24px 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\">Position Snapshot</p>\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n              <thead>\n                <tr style=\"background-color: #f9fafb;\">\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 10px 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Status</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 10px 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Holding</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: right; padding: 10px 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Value</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">\n                    <span style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px; background-color: #d1fae5; color: #059669; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;\">✅ HOLD</span>\n                  </td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight: 600;\">CASH</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\">$546.58</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"background-color: #f9fafb;\">\n                  <td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding: 12px 8px; font-weight: 700;\">TOTAL</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; text-align: right; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\">$546.58</td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <p style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280;\">No open positions — 100% cash. Zero exit alerts, zero stop/TP checks needed today.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- MOVERS -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 0 24px 24px 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\">📈 Top Gainers — Friday, Jul 31, 2026</p>\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n              <thead>\n                <tr style=\"background-color: #f9fafb;\">\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px 6px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Ticker</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: right; padding: 8px 6px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">+%</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px 6px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">What happened</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px 6px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Type</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight: 600;\">REPL</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align: right; color: #059669;\">+107%</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">FDA AdCom voted 10-3 that RP1 (oncolytic virus, melanoma) data is evaluable and clinically meaningful. Mkt cap ~$940M.</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">FDA</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight: 600;\">WK</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align: right; color: #059669;\">+32%</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Q2 beat: EPS $0.77 vs $0.66 est, revenue +19.9% YoY, raised 2026 outlook.</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Earnings</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight: 600;\">AXTI</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align: right; color: #059669;\">+23%</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Q2 beat: revenue +160% YoY on AI-datacenter indium phosphide wafer demand, gross margin to 44.9%.</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Earnings</td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 11px; color: #6b7280;\">Halal check: all 3 clean by business activity (oncology biotech, compliance SaaS, semiconductor materials). None touch a current position or watchlist name — portfolio is 100% cash.</p>\n\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\">📉 Top Losers — Friday, Jul 31, 2026</p>\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12px;\">\n              <thead>\n                <tr style=\"background-color: #f9fafb;\">\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px 6px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Ticker</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: right; padding: 8px 6px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">-%</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px 6px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">What happened</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px 6px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Type</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight: 600;\">KPTI</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align: right; color: #dc2626;\">-60%</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Phase 3 (selinexor, endometrial cancer) missed primary endpoint; extended -69% after-hours. Pivoting to myelofibrosis sNDA (Aug 2026 filing).</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Trial miss</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight: 600;\">RBLX</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align: right; color: #dc2626;\">-22.5%</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Weak Q3 outlook, withdrew FY guidance, missed user growth (bookings guided -14 to -18% YoY).</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Guidance</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight: 600;\">GDDY</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align: right; color: #dc2626;\">-20.2%</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Weak forward revenue guidance, ongoing gen-AI disruption concerns to web-hosting business.</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Guidance</td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <p style=\"margin: 6px 0 0 0; font-size: 11px; color: #6b7280;\">No contagion — no open positions or active watchlist names in these sectors.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- LARGE-CAP ON DECK -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 0 24px 24px 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\">🏢 Large-cap on deck — next 21 days</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280;\">Nothing inside the window (Aug 1–22). Most mega-caps already printed Q2 (AMZN Jul 30, AAPL ~Jul 30, MSFT Jul 29, GOOGL/TSLA Jul 22). Nearest events: <strong>NVDA</strong> — Aug 26 (25 days out), <strong>AVGO</strong> — Sep 3, <strong>TSM</strong> — Oct 15. All outside the radar window for today.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- PENDING WATCHLIST -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 0 24px 24px 24px;\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #1a1400; border-left: 3px solid #f59e0b; border-radius: 8px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 16px 20px;\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #fbbf24;\">⏳ Pending Watchlist</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 12px; color: #fde68a;\">No active candidates. All 4 tracked names have resolved and are archived — kept here for reference, not action:</p>\n                  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #fde68a; font-family: monospace;\">\n                    <tr><td style=\"padding: 3px 0;\">CELC</td><td style=\"padding: 3px 0;\">Exited Jul 15 — sell-the-news post-approval — <span style=\"color: #fca5a5;\">−$26.32</span></td></tr>\n                    <tr><td style=\"padding: 3px 0;\">CAPR</td><td style=\"padding: 3px 0;\">Stopped out Jul 27, gap fill on plain STOP — <span style=\"color: #fca5a5;\">−$234.73</span></td></tr>\n                    <tr><td style=\"padding: 3px 0;\">VRDN</td><td style=\"padding: 3px 0;\">Approved Jun 30 — entry missed (broker blocker) — no fill</td></tr>\n                    <tr><td style=\"padding: 3px 0;\">VERA</td><td style=\"padding: 3px 0;\">SL hit Jul 17 post-approval drift — <span style=\"color: #fca5a5;\">−$33.28</span></td></tr>\n                  </table>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- CASH DEPLOYMENT -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 0 24px 24px 24px;\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #eff6ff; border: 1px solid #bfdbfe; border-radius: 8px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 16px 20px;\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #1e40af;\">💵 Cash deployment — $544.58 available (after $2 reserve)</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #1e3a8a; line-height: 1.7;\">\n                    No open positions to add to, and no fresh discovery candidate is generated automatically here — that's what <strong>stock-finder</strong> is for, or <strong>halal-stock-picker</strong> for a vetted monthly list. Given the macro card above (Buffett Indicator at an all-time extreme), there's no urgency to force capital to work this weekend.<br>\n                    <em>Your call — run stock-finder when you want next candidates.</em>\n                  </p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ROTATION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 0 24px 24px 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\">🔄 Rotation Suggestions</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280;\">None — no open positions to rotate out of, and no active watchlist candidate to rotate into. Nothing to do here today.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- EDUCATION MODULE -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 0 24px 24px 24px;\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f1f5f9; border-radius: 8px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 20px 24px;\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #475569; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">📚 Today you learned</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a;\">Stop-Limit vs Stop-Market Orders</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 12px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #1e293b; line-height: 1.7;\">\n                    A plain STOP (stop-market) becomes a market order the instant it triggers — it takes whatever price is available, no matter how far the stock has gapped. A stop-limit adds a floor: once triggered, it only fills at your limit price or better. CAPR is the case study — stop was correctly placed at $14, but it was a plain stop, and when the stock gapped down pre-AdCom the order filled at $5.80, 59% below trigger. A stop-limit at, say, $13.50 would have either filled near plan or not filled at all — forcing a same-day manual decision instead of a silent, catastrophic fill. The tradeoff: a stop-limit can fail to fill entirely if the gap blows through the limit too, so it's not risk-free — it just replaces \"unknown bad price\" with \"known miss, decide manually.\"\n                  </p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 12px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #475569; font-style: italic;\">\n                    Also today: <strong>Gap risk</strong> — the price discontinuity between a prior close and the next open/trigger point, most severe around binary catalysts (earnings, FDA decisions) where no continuous trading occurs to cushion the move.\n                  </p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- FOOTER -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 16px 24px 24px 24px; border-top: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 10px; color: #9ca3af; line-height: 1.5;\">\n              Research output, not financial advice. Past performance does not guarantee future results.\n              Verify halal compliance quarterly on Zoya or Musaffa. No open positions — no live price feed needed today.\n              Movers/macro sourced via web search (GuruFocus, MacroMicro, StockTitan, company earnings coverage) — Aug 1, 2026, ~06:00 Kuwait time.\n            </p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n"}